{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ESNext",
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "lib": [
      "ESNext",
      "DOM",
      "DOM.Iterable"
    ],
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "jsxImportSource": "vue",
    "types": [
      "node",
      "vite/client"
    ],
    /* 用户要求：strict 全开 */
    "strict": true,
    "noImplicitAny": true,
    "strictNullChecks": true,
    "strictFunctionTypes": true,
    "strictBindCallApply": true,
    "strictPropertyInitialization": true,
    "noImplicitThis": true,
    "alwaysStrict": true,
    /* 迁移期降低噪音，但不放松类型正确性 */
    "noUnusedLocals": false,
    "noUnusedParameters": false,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": false,
    "useUnknownInCatchVariables": false,
    /* 工程内的 .js 已全部清除或转为 TypeScript，关掉 allowJs 作为守门：
       若以后有 .js 混进 include，vue-tsc 会直接报错而不是静默放过 */
    "allowJs": false,
    /* script/**\/*.mts 之间用显式后缀互引（`./template.mts`）——
       Node 的 CJS 解析不认 .ts 后缀，原生 TS 必须走 ESM + 写全后缀。
       本选项只允许该写法，配合已有的 noEmit: true 使用 */
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "allowSyntheticDefaultImports": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": false,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": [
        "src/*"
      ],
      "@layouts": [
        "src/layouts/index.ts"
      ],
      "@layouts/*": [
        "src/layouts/*"
      ],
      "@router": [
        "src/router/index.ts"
      ],
      "@router/*": [
        "src/router/*"
      ],
      "@api": [
        "src/api/index.ts"
      ],
      "@api/*": [
        "src/api/*"
      ],
      "@store": [
        "src/store/index.ts"
      ],
      "@store/*": [
        "src/store/*"
      ],
      "@utils": [
        "src/common/utils/index.ts"
      ],
      "@utils/*": [
        "src/common/utils/*"
      ],
      "@config": [
        "src/config/index.ts"
      ],
      "@core": [
        "src/core/index.ts"
      ],
      "@core/*": [
        "src/core/*"
      ],
      "moment": [
        "src/shims/moment.ts"
      ],
      "vue-easy-print": [
        "src/shims/vue-easy-print.ts"
      ],
      "vue-cropper": [
        "src/shims/vue-cropper.d.ts"
      ]
    }
  },
  /* 说明：
     - server.mts 刻意不在 include 里。它是 pm2 部署入口，依赖的 express@5 不带类型声明，
       纳入会直接在 `vue-tsc --noEmit`（即 yarn build 的第一步）上报 TS7016。
       这与它迁移前（server.js）的地位一致；要纳入需装 @types/express。
     - public/ 下的 particles.min.js 是运行时由 index.html 用 <script src> 加载的第三方库，
       不进打包、也不属于 TS 工程。 */
  "include": [
    "src/**/*.ts",
    "src/**/*.tsx",
    "src/**/*.d.ts",
    "src/**/*.vue",
    "env.d.ts",
    "vite.config.mts",
    "eslint.config.mts",
    "script/**/*.mts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    "dist",
    "public"
  ]
}
